WEBVTT

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:44.970
Wazzap! Furuichi here!

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:48.000
This is the Demon World! We're here, 
in the Demon World! Seriously!

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.490
Oh? Why am I so high strung?

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:52.490
I'm not that high strung, really!

00:01:52.490 --> 00:01:53.500
Totally normal!

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.930
A perfectly normal recap 
of what happened last time!

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:02.010
Alaindelon's daughter is... cute!

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:06.650
She's damn cute!

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:13.740
<b>We're Back, Demon World!</b>

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:15.140
You're creeping me out.

00:02:15.800 --> 00:02:17.400
What was that picture just now?

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.890
Um, would you stop shying 
away from me like that?

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:28.820
I'd even prefer cold stares to that.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:30.800
Cause you're creepy.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:32.200
Yeah, creepy.

00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:32.840
Hey!

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:34.880
Wait!

00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:37.840
Wait, wait! Look at this!

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:40.840
That old guy's daughter is more 
beautiful than you'd think!

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:43.080
Look at her! You too, Baby Beel!

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.350
I get it, so down boy!

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:47.260
You don't get it! This amazing beauty...

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.940
Stop it, people. Drop the subject.

00:02:50.530 --> 00:02:52.350
You're in a battle against time.

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:54.880
You do not have time to 
engage in pointless chatter.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:55.800
Hilda-san!

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:57.200
And besides...

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:59.320
Furuichi has always been creepy.

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.240
Is that so?

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:05.570
Lead you to our base?

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.050
Come on now! Don't underestimate us.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:11.180
You really think we'd sell out our buddies?

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:13.440
That's how it is.

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:16.470
Get eaten by a Demon Beast and die, scum!

00:03:16.990 --> 00:03:19.680
Royal power doesn't matter here.

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:24.390
No matter what torture you try, 
our mouths'll stay shut, pinheads!

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:26.450
That's how it is.

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:29.430
Get eaten by a Demon Beast and die, scum!

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:37.670
Over there?

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.000
This <i>is</i> the place, right?

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:43.950
R-Right! So can you...

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:47.940
She should be kept locked 
up in that highest tower!

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.300
What did he do to them?

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:53.200
Oh, I've seen this happen before...

00:03:53.930 --> 00:03:57.120
A city? Yes, I've heard of it.

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:58.960
Vlad's Den of Thieves.

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:01.150
They live in the remains of an ancient city,

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:03.790
and poach the Demon Beasts in the Haunt.

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:07.700
Hilda-san! Anyway, can I ask you something?

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:08.480
What is it?

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:12.340
U-Um... What's the name 
of the big guy's daughter?

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:15.410
Her name? Oh, yes...

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.000
Alaindelon's daughter's name is...

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:19.370
Her name is...

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:20.670
Ang...

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:25.850
It cut off! Why?

00:04:26.770 --> 00:04:29.670
Hilda-san, wait! Ang-what?

00:04:29.900 --> 00:04:32.040
That's really important!

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:33.880
No Service?!

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.140
She'd be Angie-san, right?

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:39.250
And anyway, what'll we do now?!

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.600
9(ku) times 9(ku) equals 81.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:53.600
<b>*silence*</b>

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:57.290
Come on!

00:04:57.290 --> 00:04:58.360
Laugh!

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.500
You're the best, Boss!

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:10.660
How about that? Are you reconsidering 
helping us now, Angelica-kun?

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.160
My answer is the same, 
no matter what you say.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:17.170
I have no intention of aiding thieves.

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:19.430
Release the Demon Beasts you have captured!

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:23.880
Eh, those? They ain't worth much anyway.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:28.110
If you say that you'll help 
us, whenever you like...

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:32.640
Shut up!

00:05:32.640 --> 00:05:33.800
Stop!

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:36.980
Listen well, Angelica-kun.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:39.900
You people are dimensional 
transfer demons, yes?

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.150
A thief's dream...

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:45.870
Sneak in anywhere and leave 
before anyone notices.

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:50.220
No matter how impregnable the treasure 
room, cracking it open would be a cinch!

00:05:50.440 --> 00:05:52.500
A true phantom thief.

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:54.410
That's right!

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:58.170
If it weren't for these cuffs, 
I would disappear this instant!

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:00.730
Boss!

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:02.800
Gallé and Edda sent a message!

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:06.300
Royalty?

00:06:06.300 --> 00:06:06.940
Right!

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.850
Our location here is blown?

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:11.930
Fine, no matter.

00:06:12.230 --> 00:06:14.500
What do you think you're 
doing? Stiffen the guard!

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.000
Yes, sir!

00:06:20.550 --> 00:06:23.810
Dad said he'd come home today...

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:26.690
I wonder if he's worried...

00:06:27.690 --> 00:06:29.190
This is the worst birthday ever...

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:32.800
I'm sure he's forgotten though.

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:34.370
That's not true!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:37.420
He said that he bought you a dress.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:43.080
You're...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.670
Wait for a moment. I'll head there now.

00:06:47.450 --> 00:06:49.140
Are you a friend of my father's?

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:52.730
Yes! Well, I'm a human though.

00:06:52.730 --> 00:06:53.550
Human?!

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:57.180
Hey! Why do I have to do this?

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:01.720
Furuichi-sama? Could you be Furuichi-sama?

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:04.430
Furuichi...-sama?

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:08.030
My father always speaks of you!

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.390
Yes. I have come to rescue you.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:11.490
I am Furuichi.

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:12.610
I knew it!

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:13.930
Please, escape!

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.440
A Demon Beast... A Demon Beast is coming!

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.090
A really, really big one!

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:20.850
Demon Beast?

00:07:38.210 --> 00:07:41.290
The people here have done too 
much damage to the Haunt.

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.250
Vlad's Guardian is angry.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:47.490
I can hear its voice.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:58.120
What the heck is that?

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:25.280
Um... Please help.

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.520
Vlad's Guardian?

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:37.950
Right.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:50.510
A Demon Beast bigger than even the mountains!

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.380
The people here have killed 
too many Demon Beasts...

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:57.870
The Guardian is angry!

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:11.420
You've got to be kidding me! That monster!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:13.110
Boss!

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:15.860
Where are you going, Boss?

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.980
I'm taking Angelica with 
me and getting out of here!

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:21.120
She's the only one I won't 
let out of my grasp!

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.840
Please escape, Furuichi-sama!

00:09:27.140 --> 00:09:28.460
Their boss is coming back!

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:33.240
Escape? You're saying to 
run and leave you behind?

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:37.350
But you see... I can no 
longer escape from here.

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:40.650
You think that's cool? Furuichi, you idiot!

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:43.100
Your damn head's just stuck, you jerk!

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:45.480
If we don't get out of here 
we'll be stomped flat!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.180
It's okay. It's okay!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:52.000
It's not "okay" in the slightest!

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.070
You idiot!

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:56.650
You can't get your head out?

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:57.990
Wait just a moment!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:08.320
Um, what are you...

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:09.580
Here I go!

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:10.180
Wai...

00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:26.130
You are quite stuck.

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:27.410
What shall we do?

00:10:27.960 --> 00:10:30.230
At this rate, you will suffer greatly!

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.220
She's oblivious!

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:35.020
I'm gonna get killed...

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:37.350
Angelica!

00:10:38.300 --> 00:10:40.020
What are you doing? We're 
getting out of here!

00:10:40.020 --> 00:10:41.460
This place has gone to hell!

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:44.120
A crazy monster has shown up!

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:53.220
So you're that human with a 
contract with the royal family...

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:57.190
Guess you came to rescue her, 
but it's too bad for you.

00:10:57.610 --> 00:10:59.290
Circle around and get him!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:01.730
Don't let your guard down! He 
should have friends with him!

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.340
Yes, sir!

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:03.790
You bastards!

00:11:09.500 --> 00:11:13.570
Hey, hey, hey... This is what they call 
one of those "do-or-die" moments, right?

00:11:13.930 --> 00:11:15.860
Why do you seem so happy about it?

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:17.260
I'm all excited!

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:18.520
Well, I'm not!

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:20.360
Are you some kind of warrior race?!

00:11:20.360 --> 00:11:21.530
It'll be fun.

00:11:22.190 --> 00:11:26.060
A man, see... The harder the 
situation, the more a man laughs!

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:29.040
And when he does, power 
comes flowing up naturally.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.000
Well I'm a woman!

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.490
Isn't that right, Baby Beel?

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:37.520
Baby Beel?

00:11:38.500 --> 00:11:39.510
Beelze-sama?

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.360
What're you standin' there for?

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:51.470
Master Zanga!

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:52.770
Stand aside!

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:53.760
I'll do it!

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:58.940
Royal stooges, you now 
face the fearsome Zanga!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:01.990
Fight me fair and...

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.760
W-What?!

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:10.500
Baby Beel... What exactly are you...

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:14.740
Power is overflowing from him!

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:38.000
What's that?

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:51.830
B-Baby Beel?!

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:55.060
Baby got big!

00:12:55.060 --> 00:13:00.100
I'm free! Lamia, what's wrong?! Where's Oga?

00:13:07.420 --> 00:13:09.100
Oga's on him!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:12.980
There are two monsters! What's going on?!

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:30.950
Go, Giant Beelbo!

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:44.000
What the heck.

00:13:46.900 --> 00:13:47.620
Here it comes!

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:48.470
Run for it!

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:52.150
Do a Giant Beelbo Kick!

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:57.690
Giant Beelbo Kick!

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:03.200
Gimme a...

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:03.780
You're kidding me.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.850
That hurt, you giant monster?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.040
Scary...

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:13.660
He's nuts.

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:22.040
That was close.

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.950
Things have really gotten fun!

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:28.940
Ready, Baby Beel? Next up, do 
a Giant Beelbo Clothesline!

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:34.500
Baby Beel?

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:43.920
Giant Beelbo... Clothesline!

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:47.940
Giant Beelbo... Elbow!

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:51.490
Now the final blow!

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:55.750
Giant Beelbo...

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:58.900
Boston Crab!

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:22.210
He did it!

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:25.340
That big baby-looking thing beat the monster!

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:28.020
Wow! Was it protecting us?

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:29.730
Amazing!

00:15:29.730 --> 00:15:31.660
I mean, most of the city 
is destroyed, but hey...

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:41.390
What is it trying to do?!

00:15:44.600 --> 00:15:46.050
I can't believe this...

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:47.420
My city...

00:15:47.830 --> 00:15:49.990
Hold it. That's as far as you go.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:54.110
Would you do me a favor and let 
her go... my fine-bearded friend?

00:15:54.940 --> 00:15:56.970
Or maybe you'd like to dance with me?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:58.710
Furuichi-sama!

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:00.810
You little brat!

00:16:00.950 --> 00:16:03.530
Idiot! You're actually a complete idiot!

00:16:03.800 --> 00:16:05.940
I know you're totally weak.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.670
A dagger, is it?

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.400
Don't even try it.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.070
He pulled a knife!

00:16:13.760 --> 00:16:14.850
Someone's gonna get hurt...

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:16.080
...like me!

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:17.990
Huh? What do you mean?

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:21.050
Crap! I thought he looked weak!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:24.710
What? Well, you know... that.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:25.500
What?

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:29.630
You see, there's this death move passed 
down through the generations...

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:32.170
Between the eldest and third to eldest son...

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.990
What are you talking about?!

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:42.900
Um...

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:44.000
In other words.

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.640
This happens!

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:49.610
As if you <i>caused</i> that coincidence!

00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:01.930
I mean, whoa, that was close, Oga!

00:17:01.930 --> 00:17:04.160
I was in the crack between his toes!

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:06.490
I'm glad I sounded kind of cool, but...

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:08.130
Are you even listening to me?

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.350
Whoa there!

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.500
This guy's worse than the Guardian!

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:25.500
Hey now, hey now... What's going on?

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.220
Beelze-sama's out of control!

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:28.650
What are you doing, Oga?

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:29.850
Yo.

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.510
And why are you here in front of us?

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:34.350
He threw me off.

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:36.160
You're damn lucky you survived!

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:43.940
He's overly excited! We 
have to calm him somehow!

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.120
Sure, but how?

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:49.250
Lamia!

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:56.640
Stop, Baby Beel!

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:01.680
I-It's no use!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.090
It's dinner time!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:22.370
He turned back.

00:18:24.170 --> 00:18:25.040
What is he, a dog?

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:31.500
What a pain you are...

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:37.550
And like that, our adventure 
headed to its conclusion.

00:18:38.790 --> 00:18:42.750
Without their boss, the poachers 
left gradually a few at a time.

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:47.410
And with no one there, the Demon Beasts 
imprisoned in the hideout all escaped.

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:50.780
But most surprising was Angelica-san.

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:53.680
She explained the situation to 
that giant, Vlad's Guardian,

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:56.280
who went back to the Haunt...

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:03.700
And so... the time has come to say goodbye.

00:19:11.050 --> 00:19:12.890
Beelze-sama!

00:19:12.890 --> 00:19:14.840
Hey, don't cry...

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.250
But!

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:19.310
Man, you're such a little kid.

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:22.280
Are you really so upset we have to leave?

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:25.320
Who said anything about <i>you</i>?

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:30.750
I'm sad and depressed about 
having to leave Beelze-sama!

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:34.030
Who'd give a lick about you, huh? So rude!

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:36.220
This again?

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:43.570
Well... You did try to save me back there...

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.930
I'll give you my thanks for that.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:47.140
I guess.

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:54.270
Anyway, you'd better take damn 
good care of Beelze-sama!

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:56.880
If you let him get sick again, 
I'll never forgive you!

00:19:57.530 --> 00:20:01.270
Yeah. If that happens again, I'll call you.

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:07.400
Hurry up and go.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:13.680
It doesn't really matter, but transferring 
in Angelica-san would be...

00:20:13.680 --> 00:20:15.290
I wonder if she splits, too?

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.810
And then... inside her...

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:21.750
That's kind of hot...

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:23.850
Well then, shall we go?

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:25.410
Here I go!

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:27.990
Actually, my father will...

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:29.400
Hello!

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:36.850
Sorry about not saying anything... 
He just came a moment ago.

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.350
There wasn't really a time to tell you...

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:42.190
Everyone looks like they are safe and sound.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.910
And if you have your health...

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:45.930
Alaindelon!

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:46.860
Yes?

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:48.850
You're still alive?!

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:52.710
I wouldn't die from something like that.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:55.830
Screw you! Where have you been?

00:20:56.550 --> 00:20:59.440
I went to a health resort to heal my wounds.

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:06.570
<b>Demon World Health Resort
The Destopia Bloodpools</b>

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:13.050
Leaving that aside.

00:21:16.680 --> 00:21:20.310
No!!

00:21:20.310 --> 00:21:25.000
I wanted to be transferred by Angelica-san!

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:26.950
Here we go, Furuichi-dono!

00:21:33.900 --> 00:21:36.620
I will say this... for now.

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:42.500
Welcome home.

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:45.910
We're back.

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:53.600
And, like this, our long, long 
summer vacation was over.

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:04.290
Summer vacation's over, and it's a new term!

00:24:04.610 --> 00:24:06.980
But wait, Ishiyama's still destroyed, right?

00:24:07.260 --> 00:24:09.100
Looks like we're transferring 
to St. Ishiyama Academy.

00:24:09.720 --> 00:24:12.630
So why are you laughing like a creep 
and spreading butter on toast?

00:24:12.980 --> 00:24:14.140
First day, new transfer;

00:24:14.140 --> 00:24:17.150
"I'm late, I'm late"; toast in mouth; 
round the corner; bam; fall in love!

00:24:17.480 --> 00:24:20.200
On the next Beelzebub: 
The New Term Has Started!

00:24:20.800 --> 00:24:22.740
Oh, I'm late! I'm late!

00:24:23.040 --> 00:24:24.240
Furuichi-dono...

00:24:24.450 --> 00:24:26.470
I knew it'd turn out like this...
